        <mxCell id="legend" value="Box: a stock. Hourglass: a flow (its valve), named below. Bold coloured text: an&#10;auxiliary. Grey italic: a lever parameter. Thick arrow: a flow changing the&#10;stock it points to. Thin arrow: an input of the item it points to. Grey text,&#10;(module): an input from another module." style="html=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#FAFAFA;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
